#: ../../upstream/docs/user/badges.rst:34 ../../upstream/docs/user/badges.rst:41
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/badges.rst:36
msgid ""
"You can pass the ``style`` GET argument to get custom styled badges. This "
"allows you to match the look and feel of your website. By default, the "
"``flat`` style is used."
msgstr "可传入 ``style`` GET 参数获取自定义样式的徽章，从而与你的网站视觉风格保持一致。默认使用 ``flat`` 样式。"

