#: ../../upstream/docs/user/badges.rst:62
msgid "Version-specific badges"
msgstr "版本专属徽章"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/badges.rst:64
msgid ""
"You can change the version of the documentation your badge points to. To do "
"this, you can pass the ``version`` GET argument to the badge URL. By "
"default, it will point at the *default version* you have specified for your "
"project."
msgstr "你可以改变徽章所指向的文档版本。为此可向徽章 URL 传入 ``version`` GET 参数。默认指向你为项目指定的*默认版本* 。"

