#: ../../upstream/docs/user/badges.rst:119
msgid ""
"For private projects, a badge URL cannot be guessed. A token is needed to "
"display it. Please :doc:`contact support </support>` to get the badge URL "
"for your private project."
msgstr "对私有项目，徽章 URL 无法猜测，需要令牌才能显示。请 :doc:`联系支持 </support>` 获取你私有项目的徽章 URL。"

